            "text": "/-- `∑_{r ≤ y odd} ∑_{d | r} 1/√(rd) ≤ (1 - 2^{-3/2}) ζ(3/2) √y`. -/\ntheorem sum_odd_divisors_le {y : ℝ} (hy : 0 ≤ y) :\n    ∑ r ∈ (Icc 1 ⌊y⌋₊).filter Odd, ∑ d ∈ r.divisors, 1 / √((r : ℝ) * d) ≤\n      (1 - 2 ^ (-(3 / 2) : ℝ)) * (riemannZeta (3 / 2)).re * √y := by",
